(6435396, 955612, 81042, '<td valign="top">beautiful sunrise/sunset. A little over done on the HDR.</td>', 'beautiful sunrise/sunset. A little over done on the HDR.', '2011-06-06 04:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435415, 955529, 81042, '<td valign="top">love it. great job with the depth of field and lighting. 8</td>', 'love it. great job with the depth of field and lighting. 8', '2011-06-06 04:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435416, 955465, 27812, '<td valign="top">If this horizon was straight... if only!</td>', 'If this horizon was straight... if only!', '2011-06-06 04:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435423, 955571, 81042, '<td valign="top">strange crop but like the picture. 8</td>', 'strange crop but like the picture. 8', '2011-06-06 05:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435429, 955675, 27812, '<td valign="top">Saturation on the sky unnatural.</td>', 'Saturation on the sky unnatural.', '2011-06-06 05:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435430, 955445, 81042, '<td valign="top">Favorite so far. 9</td>', 'Favorite so far. 9', '2011-06-06 05:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435434, 955666, 106484, '<td valign="top">A little over-sharpened maybe? Nice composition though.</td>', 'A little over-sharpened maybe? Nice composition though.', '2011-06-06 05:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435441, 955352, 81042, '<td valign="top">This picture has some great potential. IMO here are a couple of things you could try to add impact. First go with a long exposure (you might need a ND filter to increase your exposure time). That would give the water a nice smooth look. Then you might try desaturating the image thus giving the water and the sky the same tones which would then pop the cottage out. Of course that is just so ideas of what I might have done if I found myself in the same place. Cheers!</td>', 'This picture has some great potential. IMO here are a couple of things you could try to add impact. First go with a long exposure (you might need a ND filter to increase your exposure time). That would give the water a nice smooth look. Then you might try desaturating the image thus giving the water and the sky the same tones which would then pop the cottage out. Of course that is just so ideas of what I might have done if I found myself in the same place. Cheers!', '2011-06-06 05:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435446, 955533, 81042, '<td valign="top">unfortunately very small size.</td>', 'unfortunately very small size.', '2011-06-06 05:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435447, 955673, 81042, '<td valign="top">Love the concept. The white is a little overwhelming. Even so well done. 6</td>', 'Love the concept. The white is a little overwhelming. Even so well done. 6', '2011-06-06 05:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435497, 955656, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great sense of motion. Like the clouds are blowing off the tree.</td>', 'Great sense of motion. Like the clouds are blowing off the tree.', '2011-06-06 07:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435498, 955427, 101668, '<td valign="top">Now who is this if its not me? Love the scene and picture.</td>', 'Now who is this if its not me? Love the scene and picture.', '2011-06-06 07:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435499, 955490, 60173, '<td valign="top">The tree is definitely captivating, but I can''t help but wonder if a square crop would have been more fitting.</td>', 'The tree is definitely captivating, but I can''t help but wonder if a square crop would have been more fitting.', '2011-06-06 07:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435501, 955268, 101668, '<td valign="top">this would always be a winner. lovely tones and mood and lighting real good</td>', 'this would always be a winner. lovely tones and mood and lighting real good', '2011-06-06 07:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435503, 955348, 101668, '<td valign="top">In my humble (very humble!) opinion the sun is too bright. The rest is amazing</td>', 'In my humble (very humble!) opinion the sun is too bright. The rest is amazing', '2011-06-06 07:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435504, 955561, 101668, '<td valign="top">Ah great. Very difficult to photograph snow and a lovely eye. This is real good</td>', 'Ah great. Very difficult to photograph snow and a lovely eye. This is real good', '2011-06-06 07:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435505, 954836, 101668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. simply breathtaking</td>', 'Beautiful. simply breathtaking', '2011-06-06 07:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435507, 955435, 101668, '<td valign="top">Maybe too minimalistic? This won''t catch my eye anywhere but the technique is good</td>', 'Maybe too minimalistic? This won''t catch my eye anywhere but the technique is good', '2011-06-06 07:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435509, 955268, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''d really like this except it appears that there was some sloppy cloning done in the grass. Did you clone out a fence?</td>', 'I''d really like this except it appears that there was some sloppy cloning done in the grass. Did you clone out a fence?', '2011-06-06 07:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435516, 955655, 101668, '<td valign="top">Without the trees in the background, I would have given this a highter score. 6</td>', 'Without the trees in the background, I would have given this a highter score. 6', '2011-06-06 07:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435517, 955626, 101668, '<td valign="top">Nice processing lovely tone and atmosphere 7</td>', 'Nice processing lovely tone and atmosphere 7', '2011-06-06 07:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435523, 955443, 101668, '<td valign="top">Not my idea of minimalistic no vote cause of personal taste</td>', 'Not my idea of minimalistic no vote cause of personal taste', '2011-06-06 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435563, 955006, 101668, '<td valign="top">I do not regard this as a landscape but rather a skyscape but the technique is good</td>', 'I do not regard this as a landscape but rather a skyscape but the technique is good', '2011-06-06 08:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435580, 955428, 45631, '<td valign="top">By the shape of that tree I''m guessing this is Vlado''s.  Really love that tree and this is the perfect image for this challenge but I find its a bit dark.  <br/> <br/>(As soon as this challenge was announced I thought of your images and how perfect this would be if only I lived in Victoria.  Wondered if you would go and shoot this image .... and here it is).</td>', 'By the shape of that tree I''m guessing this is Vlado''s.  Really love that tree and this is the perfect image for this challenge but I find its a bit dark.   (As soon as this challenge was announced I thought of your images and how perfect this would be if only I lived in Victoria.  Wondered if you would go and shoot this image .... and here it is).', '2011-06-06 08:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435586, 954291, 45631, '<td valign="top">I quite like abstract images but this one doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I quite like abstract images but this one doesn''t work for me.', '2011-06-06 09:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435588, 954843, 101668, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge Great photography</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge Great photography', '2011-06-06 09:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435590, 955140, 45631, '<td valign="top">I actually quite like tilted horizons but the tilt needs to dominate the image to show it was done on purpose where as this is not titled enough to give it that dynamic.  The image as a whole is not very interesting and I don''t feel it meets the Minimalist part of the challenge.</td>', 'I actually quite like tilted horizons but the tilt needs to dominate the image to show it was done on purpose where as this is not titled enough to give it that dynamic.  The image as a whole is not very interesting and I don''t feel it meets the Minimalist part of the challenge.', '2011-06-06 09:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435591, 955642, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice image but I feel you have missed the minimalist part of the challenge that was required.</td>', 'This is a really nice image but I feel you have missed the minimalist part of the challenge that was required.', '2011-06-06 09:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435592, 954908, 45631, '<td valign="top">For me this image doesn''t meet the challenge.  It''s very dark and doesn''t hold much of interest to view.</td>', 'For me this image doesn''t meet the challenge.  It''s very dark and doesn''t hold much of interest to view.', '2011-06-06 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435595, 955643, 101668, '<td valign="top">My first 10 of the challenge. This is so so good on so many levels. Great photography, lovely processing</td>', 'My first 10 of the challenge. This is so so good on so many levels. Great photography, lovely processing', '2011-06-06 09:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435596, 955533, 45631, '<td valign="top">Please learn how to resize your images correctly as it is hard to judge such a small image.  This image doesn''t work for me for this challenge.  Composition is poor, needs work in levels and I don''t feel the subject has meet the challenge very well.</td>', 'Please learn how to resize your images correctly as it is hard to judge such a small image.  This image doesn''t work for me for this challenge.  Composition is poor, needs work in levels and I don''t feel the subject has meet the challenge very well.', '2011-06-06 09:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435599, 955006, 45631, '<td valign="top">When it''s a ''landscape'' I expect to see at least a little bit of land in the image so this hasn''t meet the challenge for me.</td>', 'When it''s a ''landscape'' I expect to see at least a little bit of land in the image so this hasn''t meet the challenge for me.', '2011-06-06 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435600, 954936, 45631, '<td valign="top">Whilst I don''t think the composition of this image has meet the challenge I think the processing is it''s greatest downfall.</td>', 'Whilst I don''t think the composition of this image has meet the challenge I think the processing is it''s greatest downfall.', '2011-06-06 09:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435601, 955607, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have photographed a hidden gem of a landscape. It seems to take me back in time to a point when the creation was largely uninhabited. It is definitely a found spot. My interpretation of a minimalist landscape is to show a photograph of a largely uncluttered space to show it''s openness. It''s major compositional element is the use of negative space to create a focus point on the subject. Here the subject is a definite closed space. I love the photo, but it is not really minimalist.</td>', 'You have photographed a hidden gem of a landscape. It seems to take me back in time to a point when the creation was largely uninhabited. It is definitely a found spot. My interpretation of a minimalist landscape is to show a photograph of a largely uncluttered space to show it''s openness. It''s major compositional element is the use of negative space to create a focus point on the subject. Here the subject is a definite closed space. I love the photo, but it is not really minimalist.', '2011-06-06 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435605, 955428, 10785, '<td valign="top">I wonder if you could have recomposed to put the subject in the right hand third of the image. I see the mountain range in the background on the left with the tip of the branch pointing right to it. It might have made for a stronger composition. Everything else was done well. I don''t mind that this appears a hair dark.</td>', 'I wonder if you could have recomposed to put the subject in the right hand third of the image. I see the mountain range in the background on the left with the tip of the branch pointing right to it. It might have made for a stronger composition. Everything else was done well. I don''t mind that this appears a hair dark.', '2011-06-06 09:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435609, 955656, 10785, '<td valign="top">That lean is great! Was it actually a windy day? If so I wonder if you could have used a slower shutter speed to show the movement in the grass. That would have added a terrific element to the exposure. But I am voting on what is and not what could have been. Love the blueish grey tones. Very good depth of shadow and light shown. Also the vignetting adds to the scene in my opinion.</td>', 'That lean is great! Was it actually a windy day? If so I wonder if you could have used a slower shutter speed to show the movement in the grass. That would have added a terrific element to the exposure. But I am voting on what is and not what could have been. Love the blueish grey tones. Very good depth of shadow and light shown. Also the vignetting adds to the scene in my opinion.', '2011-06-06 09:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435612, 955519, 10785, '<td valign="top">I love this for it''s impressionism. The blur and the movement is really dynamic. I think it missed slightly on the minimalism aspect... but only slightly.</td>', 'I love this for it''s impressionism. The blur and the movement is really dynamic. I think it missed slightly on the minimalism aspect... but only slightly.', '2011-06-06 09:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435620, 955531, 101668, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene although not minimalistic "enough"</td>', 'Very nice scene although not minimalistic "enough"', '2011-06-06 09:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435621, 954859, 101668, '<td valign="top">Interesting crop you got here.</td>', 'Interesting crop you got here.', '2011-06-06 09:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435622, 955676, 101668, '<td valign="top">My kind a picture. So lovely 8</td>', 'My kind a picture. So lovely 8', '2011-06-06 09:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435624, 955642, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have the landscape portion down well. Good use of shutter speed to show the movement of the water. Nice exposure for the light, very evenly lit. I feel you missed on the minimalism. Minimalist landscapes ought to show wide open spaces and typically use negative space as a compositional tool.</td>', 'You have the landscape portion down well. Good use of shutter speed to show the movement of the water. Nice exposure for the light, very evenly lit. I feel you missed on the minimalism. Minimalist landscapes ought to show wide open spaces and typically use negative space as a compositional tool.', '2011-06-06 09:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435625, 955671, 10785, '<td valign="top">A beautiful landscape scene and well shot. I just feel you missed on the minimalism aspect of the challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful landscape scene and well shot. I just feel you missed on the minimalism aspect of the challenge.', '2011-06-06 09:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435628, 955680, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice use of impressionism to produce the minimalism in the landscape. Everything has been narrowed down to shape and tone and light. It is no a B&amp;W so it is lacking slightly in color but all the other elements are their.</td>', 'Nice use of impressionism to produce the minimalism in the landscape. Everything has been narrowed down to shape and tone and light. It is no a B&W so it is lacking slightly in color but all the other elements are their.', '2011-06-06 09:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435629, 954920, 118461, '<td valign="top">nice b&amp;w</td>', 'nice b&w', '2011-06-06 09:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435632, 955427, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would like to see a little more sky to accentuate the minimalism. Or a higher point of view to get more of the gold tones of the plains which may not have been possible.</td>', 'I would like to see a little more sky to accentuate the minimalism. Or a higher point of view to get more of the gold tones of the plains which may not have been possible.', '2011-06-06 09:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435633, 955626, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love the noise and the use of monotone blues. The tree is slightly off for rule of thirds, but it is great alone in the field.</td>', 'Love the noise and the use of monotone blues. The tree is slightly off for rule of thirds, but it is great alone in the field.', '2011-06-06 09:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435634, 954936, 43774, '<td valign="top">Waaaaaaaaaaay overprocessed, not liking the colours or glow. Not sure it''s minimal enough for the challenge either. Something simpler would have worked much better, good luck.</td>', 'Waaaaaaaaaaay overprocessed, not liking the colours or glow. Not sure it''s minimal enough for the challenge either. Something simpler would have worked much better, good luck.', '2011-06-06 09:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
