(6435911, 954908, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am open to the interpretation that you have shown a minimal amount of landscape in your photo. I think the shot has been given too much conttrast and is a little on the dark side.</td>', 'I am open to the interpretation that you have shown a minimal amount of landscape in your photo. I think the shot has been given too much conttrast and is a little on the dark side.', '2011-06-06 15:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435912, 955238, 10785, '<td valign="top">Definite minimalism with the line. I think overall the tones of the shot are a drab medium grey and not very exciting. Nothing real dynamic to the composition other than the zig zag line and the off center placement of the subject. Perhaps a more overhead view would have added some needed perspective.</td>', 'Definite minimalism with the line. I think overall the tones of the shot are a drab medium grey and not very exciting. Nothing real dynamic to the composition other than the zig zag line and the off center placement of the subject. Perhaps a more overhead view would have added some needed perspective.', '2011-06-06 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435915, 955655, 10785, '<td valign="top">There are some exposure problems here. The field has that nice golden glow from the sunset lighting, however the sky is fairly blown out. Perhaps the use of a polarizer or a graduated neutral density filter could have helped. Or bracketing exposures and combining as an HDR would have helped even the exposure of the foreground and the background.</td>', 'There are some exposure problems here. The field has that nice golden glow from the sunset lighting, however the sky is fairly blown out. Perhaps the use of a polarizer or a graduated neutral density filter could have helped. Or bracketing exposures and combining as an HDR would have helped even the exposure of the foreground and the background.', '2011-06-06 15:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435918, 955561, 10785, '<td valign="top">Watch those edges... the blue corner in the upper left is a distraction.</td>', 'Watch those edges... the blue corner in the upper left is a distraction.', '2011-06-06 15:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
