(6435942, 955664, 126371, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where you are, but we''ve had that same haze around here too... Nice photo---great mood. Hope you do well...</td>', 'I don''t know where you are, but we''ve had that same haze around here too... Nice photo---great mood. Hope you do well...', '2011-06-06 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
