(6435956, 955667, 126371, '<td valign="top">Wow---that must have been an incredible moment to see that. The reflection''s nice but do you think a close up up that distant mountain with the trees in the foreground might have yeilded less blue sky (less ''empty'' space)?</td>', 'Wow---that must have been an incredible moment to see that. The reflection''s nice but do you think a close up up that distant mountain with the trees in the foreground might have yeilded less blue sky (less ''empty'' space)?', '2011-06-06 16:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435978, 955443, 121789, '<td valign="top">This sure looks like the canyon between Skyway and 32 in Chico . . . One of my favorite views!</td>', 'This sure looks like the canyon between Skyway and 32 in Chico . . . One of my favorite views!', '2011-06-06 16:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6435993, 955060, 109387, '<td valign="top">The idea was good but why did you cut the buildings? Moreover I think that the light was too strong.</td>', 'The idea was good but why did you cut the buildings? Moreover I think that the light was too strong.', '2011-06-06 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
