(6437211, 955561, 68947, '<td valign="top">OMG...WHERE do you live?!  That must made me shiver and it''s 30 Degrees Celsius here LOL!  I hope to NOT see that again for MONTHS to come.  Not sure this is minimal landscape but, I suppose it could fit loosely. :)  (not scoring)</td>', 'OMG...WHERE do you live?!  That must made me shiver and it''s 30 Degrees Celsius here LOL!  I hope to NOT see that again for MONTHS to come.  Not sure this is minimal landscape but, I suppose it could fit loosely. :)  (not scoring)', '2011-06-07 17:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437212, 955623, 68947, '<td valign="top">beautiful colours, textures and patterns.</td>', 'beautiful colours, textures and patterns.', '2011-06-07 17:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437213, 955445, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!  Love the editing!</td>', 'Very pretty!  Love the editing!', '2011-06-07 17:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
