(6437222, 955563, 68947, '<td valign="top">Minimal but, a little bit boring, wondering if perhaps, having cropped down to just more of a line of the snow and more of the mound might have helped this a bit more?  The mount is quite textured so, it might have been a bit more interesting a view point.  The snow is rather bland and too much of the picture IMO but, not scoring, just commenting</td>', 'Minimal but, a little bit boring, wondering if perhaps, having cropped down to just more of a line of the snow and more of the mound might have helped this a bit more?  The mount is quite textured so, it might have been a bit more interesting a view point.  The snow is rather bland and too much of the picture IMO but, not scoring, just commenting', '2011-06-07 17:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437223, 955238, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL....great shot with an interesting pattern</td>', 'LOL....great shot with an interesting pattern', '2011-06-07 17:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437224, 955176, 68947, '<td valign="top">not quite sure what to say here except that it''s more like a half portrait of a tree? LOL  (not scoring) but, wondering if perhaps, having moved to the side a bit and gotten part of the tree to one side might have helped it more?</td>', 'not quite sure what to say here except that it''s more like a half portrait of a tree? LOL  (not scoring) but, wondering if perhaps, having moved to the side a bit and gotten part of the tree to one side might have helped it more?', '2011-06-07 17:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437225, 955665, 68947, '<td valign="top">very vivid and textured.  Nicely done.</td>', 'very vivid and textured.  Nicely done.', '2011-06-07 17:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437226, 955446, 68947, '<td valign="top">Almost a 3D effect!  That main cloud looks like it''s coming out of the shot.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Almost a 3D effect!  That main cloud looks like it''s coming out of the shot.  Nicely done.', '2011-06-07 18:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437227, 955668, 68947, '<td valign="top">the blue is so appealing in what would otherwise be a rather dull, boring shot.  Nice choice.</td>', 'the blue is so appealing in what would otherwise be a rather dull, boring shot.  Nice choice.', '2011-06-07 18:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437228, 955607, 68947, '<td valign="top">Not sure that I''d consider this minimal landscape but, the rock wall is beautiful.  Not scoring, just commenting.</td>', 'Not sure that I''d consider this minimal landscape but, the rock wall is beautiful.  Not scoring, just commenting.', '2011-06-07 18:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
