(6437234, 955345, 68947, '<td valign="top">How does one say interesting and yet boring at the same time?  I can''t put my finger on why but, while it''s boring, it''s also interesting at the same time.  Maybe, it''s wondering what lays beyond that land line???? LOL  I''m wondering if a higher saturation of colour or a complete B&amp;W might have made this totally interesting?  (Just commenting, not scoring)</td>', 'How does one say interesting and yet boring at the same time?  I can''t put my finger on why but, while it''s boring, it''s also interesting at the same time.  Maybe, it''s wondering what lays beyond that land line???? LOL  I''m wondering if a higher saturation of colour or a complete B&W might have made this totally interesting?  (Just commenting, not scoring)', '2011-06-07 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437235, 954920, 68947, '<td valign="top">Looks like the trees drew the clouds.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Looks like the trees drew the clouds.  Nice capture.', '2011-06-07 18:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437236, 955374, 68947, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure that this shot is as appealing as it could have been but, the colours are really pretty.  (not scoring, just commenting)</td>', 'Not quite sure that this shot is as appealing as it could have been but, the colours are really pretty.  (not scoring, just commenting)', '2011-06-07 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
