(6437243, 955349, 68947, '<td valign="top">not sure I''d consider this minimal landscape but, it''s a very interesting shot (not scoring, just commenting)</td>', 'not sure I''d consider this minimal landscape but, it''s a very interesting shot (not scoring, just commenting)', '2011-06-07 18:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437247, 955326, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really pretty but, I''m wondering if you''re getting dinged on score by the editing.  (not scoring, just commenting)</td>', 'Really pretty but, I''m wondering if you''re getting dinged on score by the editing.  (not scoring, just commenting)', '2011-06-07 18:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437250, 954291, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL...one that makes me scratch my head, stare at it, think, stare some more and ask myself....what do I say?  I like it but, it''s not miminal landscape and yet, it''s interesting but, not minimal landscape and then....think....I''m glad that I''m just commenting and not scoring! :)</td>', 'LOL...one that makes me scratch my head, stare at it, think, stare some more and ask myself....what do I say?  I like it but, it''s not miminal landscape and yet, it''s interesting but, not minimal landscape and then....think....I''m glad that I''m just commenting and not scoring! :)', '2011-06-07 18:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
