(6437255, 955673, 68947, '<td valign="top">YUP....dune.....very contrasted...interesting but, kind of leaves me wondering what to feel about it (Don''t worry, not scoring, just commenting)</td>', 'YUP....dune.....very contrasted...interesting but, kind of leaves me wondering what to feel about it (Don''t worry, not scoring, just commenting)', '2011-06-07 18:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437261, 955676, 68947, '<td valign="top">is that burning that you''ve done with the tracks in the distance?  Maybe, a bit too heavy handed with it?  Not sure what I''m seeing but, doesn''t look like natural tracks.  However, nice shot.  (not scoring)</td>', 'is that burning that you''ve done with the tracks in the distance?  Maybe, a bit too heavy handed with it?  Not sure what I''m seeing but, doesn''t look like natural tracks.  However, nice shot.  (not scoring)', '2011-06-07 18:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437262, 955430, 68947, '<td valign="top">Interesting piece...abstract almost</td>', 'Interesting piece...abstract almost', '2011-06-07 18:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437263, 955533, 68947, '<td valign="top">Oooo...would have been really nice had it been larger.  Use your full pixel alottment because this is going to get dinged for being so small in sizing.  Use the full 800 on one side.  It looks interesting.  (not scoring)</td>', 'Oooo...would have been really nice had it been larger.  Use your full pixel alottment because this is going to get dinged for being so small in sizing.  Use the full 800 on one side.  It looks interesting.  (not scoring)', '2011-06-07 18:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437264, 955683, 68947, '<td valign="top">Well this is another way to avoid the controversy over what constitutes mimimal landscape...go abstract and let ''em all wonder LOL ;)  (not scoring)</td>', 'Well this is another way to avoid the controversy over what constitutes mimimal landscape...go abstract and let ''em all wonder LOL ;)  (not scoring)', '2011-06-07 18:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437266, 955496, 68947, '<td valign="top">Pretty!</td>', 'Pretty!', '2011-06-07 18:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437268, 955681, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok...we have a portrait of a tree...nicely shot, great in B&amp;W but, minimal landscape?  Not sure and good thing that I''m only commenting, not scoring LOL ;)</td>', 'Ok...we have a portrait of a tree...nicely shot, great in B&W but, minimal landscape?  Not sure and good thing that I''m only commenting, not scoring LOL ;)', '2011-06-07 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6437269, 955292, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok...you did what I had thought of doing.  Forget running around, trying to find a pretty, minimal natural landscape to shoot....CREATE ONE!  Love it for that reason! :)</td>', 'Ok...you did what I had thought of doing.  Forget running around, trying to find a pretty, minimal natural landscape to shoot....CREATE ONE!  Love it for that reason! :)', '2011-06-07 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
