(6441808, 955465, 124815, '<td valign="top">Solid, desolate image. Did you try it in B&amp;W? I like the tonality very much though. Only that the line of the horizon reverses the perspective in which case a crop of the sky above would be beneficial.</td>', 'Solid, desolate image. Did you try it in B&W? I like the tonality very much though. Only that the line of the horizon reverses the perspective in which case a crop of the sky above would be beneficial.', '2011-06-12 12:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
