(6441811, 954452, 124815, '<td valign="top">The tonality is nice but to me it does not seem to benefit such a wonderful image being too obviously manipulated. It''s too saturated perhaps, the upper corners are too obvious, the mountains hesitate between not being defined much or not blurry enough. <br/>But all in all, the picture has a quality of a painting. 6</td>', 'The tonality is nice but to me it does not seem to benefit such a wonderful image being too obviously manipulated. It''s too saturated perhaps, the upper corners are too obvious, the mountains hesitate between not being defined much or not blurry enough. But all in all, the picture has a quality of a painting. 6', '2011-06-12 12:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
