(6441983, 955146, 124815, '<td valign="top">This is such a spectacularly subtle image (and I think we know whose it is) that I feel like crying seeing the ruthless black lines killing it! It frustrates me deeply. It would have been a 9+ but I lower it to<strike> 6</strike> 7 upon looking at it several more times. And as of the last look, I wish the mountain would be a touch paler to allow for the layers of air. Nice images get more and sometimes harsher comments!</td>', 'This is such a spectacularly subtle image (and I think we know whose it is) that I feel like crying seeing the ruthless black lines killing it! It frustrates me deeply. It would have been a 9+ but I lower it to 6 7 upon looking at it several more times. And as of the last look, I wish the mountain would be a touch paler to allow for the layers of air. Nice images get more and sometimes harsher comments!', '2011-06-12 17:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441984, 955465, 11769, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2011-06-12 17:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441985, 955146, 11769, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful scene.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful scene.', '2011-06-12 17:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441987, 955456, 124815, '<td valign="top">A striking picture that requires a lot of "readings". I do not think of it as minimalist though and for a while, while looking at it, I forgot that it was part of a specific challenge - a sign of a good image. <br/>The tonality is very well suited for the subject. <br/>I have a slight curiosity: would this image benefit from slightly more "air" at the top and bottom?  Or is this near crop forcing us to confront its meaning even more? 8</td>', 'A striking picture that requires a lot of "readings". I do not think of it as minimalist though and for a while, while looking at it, I forgot that it was part of a specific challenge - a sign of a good image. The tonality is very well suited for the subject. I have a slight curiosity: would this image benefit from slightly more "air" at the top and bottom?  Or is this near crop forcing us to confront its meaning even more? 8', '2011-06-12 17:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6441998, 955352, 108580, '<td valign="top">Simple natural image, not over HDR''d to death, thanky you! Love the title too btw... :)</td>', 'Simple natural image, not over HDR''d to death, thanky you! Love the title too btw... :)', '2011-06-12 18:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442004, 955268, 108580, '<td valign="top">A beaut.</td>', 'A beaut.', '2011-06-12 18:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442005, 955653, 108580, '<td valign="top">We are not worthy...</td>', 'We are not worthy...', '2011-06-12 18:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6442006, 955571, 108580, '<td valign="top">Stunning</td>', 'Stunning', '2011-06-12 18:16:28.000000', NULL, 1);
