(6442302, 955623, 68504, '<td valign="top">The colour is strange but very effective, and I like being plunged into the foreground velveteen/corduroy texture of the wavy field.</td>', 'The colour is strange but very effective, and I like being plunged into the foreground velveteen/corduroy texture of the wavy field.', '2011-06-13 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
