(6457005, 954920, 69008, '<td valign="top">Love the "mare''s tails", and the lanky palms compliment them nicely. Even the background behind the palms cooperated to accentuate the trunks because of you using a low point of view.   B&amp;W is good for this too, because the interplay of shapes and light and dark are what makes the shot.</td>', 'Love the "mare''s tails", and the lanky palms compliment them nicely. Even the background behind the palms cooperated to accentuate the trunks because of you using a low point of view.   B&W is good for this too, because the interplay of shapes and light and dark are what makes the shot.', '2011-06-30 22:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
